# Skill: RecurringTasks
Description: Manage recurring tasks (daily/weekly/monthly auto-reschedule on completion).
Tool: create_todo(user_id, title, recurring_pattern="weekly")
Purpose: Auto-create next task instance when a recurring task is completed.
Usage: "Add task weekly standup repeat weekly" -> create_todo(title="Weekly standup", recurring_pattern="weekly").
Flow: complete task -> emit_task_completed(recurring_pattern) -> Kafka "recurring-tasks" topic -> RecurringTaskConsumer -> new task with next due_date.
Patterns: daily (+1 day), weekly (+7 days), monthly (+30 days).
